## What was ordered

--panel[padding=12, margin=0 0 12 0, border=1, color=outline, radius=8]--
{{range .Order.Cart.Items}}
--listing--
title: {{ .Product.Title }}
summary: {{ .Quantity }} × {{ money .Product.Price }}{{ with .Product.SKU }} · {{.}}{{ end }}
meta: {{ money .Total }}
{{ with productImage .Product.Image }}image: {{.}}
{{ end -}}
--/listing--
{{end}}
Items: {{ money .Order.Cart.Total }}
{{ if gt .Order.ShipCharge 0.0 }}Shipping: {{ money .Order.ShipCharge }}
